			  patched ${tomcat.version} (11.0.24). Declared BEFORE spring-boot-dependencies so these
			  win over the Boot BOM's vulnerable 11.0.22 (CVE-2026-55276/-53434/-59083/-59084/-53404).
			  Tomcat has no published BOM, so each managed artifact is pinned explicitly. See the
			  tomcat.version property in stubborn-contract-build/pom.xml. Remove once Boot ships >= 11.0.24.
			-->
